The shell draws the site bar with the brand, the Docs, Blog and GitHub links, the sign-in link and the waitlist button, and the site footer with the product, resources and legal columns and the copyright line. The app draws the real addresses and the source and social icons, and the export shows a subset in text. The children fill the page between them. The component emits the real `lp-home` classes of the app.
